  <p id="c-beishi-016-yuanzhan-falun:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-beishi-016-yuanzhan-falun:p001:m0000" ref="2a3_ci1_y4y">湛</persName>子<persName id="c-beishi-016-yuanzhan-falun:p001:m0002" ref="2a3_ci1_y4y_A">法輪</persName>，<persName id="c-beishi-016-yuanzhan-falun:p001:m0005" ref="ndd_nmw_kcl">紫光</persName>所生也。齊王矜<persName id="c-beishi-016-yuanzhan-falun:p001:m0014" ref="2a3_ci1_y4y">湛</persName>覆滅，乃啟原之，復其爵土。</p>
